<title>TUNISIA: EMIRATES BANK H1 PRETAX SHARPLY UP.</title>
<headline>EMIRATES BANK H1 PRETAX SHARPLY UP.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian-Emirates Investment Bank made a 2.368 million dinar pre-tax profit during the first half of 1997, up from 1.481 million dinars during the same period last year, provisional results showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Total balance sheet amounted to 200.442 million dinars against 189.707 milion dinars.</p>
<p>The Tunis-based BTEI is a joint venture between United Arab Emirates public funds and the Tunisian state. It has a capital of 90 million dinars. ($=1.168 dinar)</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
